[15.208, "o", "\u001b[1mapp.yaml  Deployment/orders-api\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[31m\u2716 error  \u001b[0m \u001b[2mLV005\u001b[0m  container \"api\": requests.cpu 4 exceeds LimitRange \"shop-limits\" max 2\u001b[2m (line 1)\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[31m\u2716 error  \u001b[0m \u001b[2mLV005\u001b[0m  container \"api\": limits.memory 8Gi exceeds LimitRange \"shop-limits\" max 4Gi\u001b[2m (line 1)\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[31m\u2716 error  \u001b[0m \u001b[2mLV003\u001b[0m  pod requests 4 CPU but the largest matching node (node-a) has 3920m allocatable: pods will stay Pending\u001b[2m (line 1)\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[31m\u2716 error  \u001b[0m \u001b[2mLV004\u001b[0m  needs requests.cpu=15 more (4 replica(s)) but ResourceQuota \"shop-compute\" in namespace \"shop\" only has 9 left (hard 12, used 3): pods will be rejected\u001b[2m (line 1)\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[31m\u2716 error  \u001b[0m \u001b[2mLV004\u001b[0m  needs requests.memory=31Gi more (4 replica(s)) but ResourceQuota \"shop-compute\" in namespace \"shop\" only has 26Gi left (hard 32Gi, used 6Gi): pods will be rejected\u001b[2m (line 1)\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n5 error(s), 0 warning(s), 0 info\r\n"]
